# The worker image (worker/Dockerfile, built by `flyctl deploy` from the repo
# root) copies only package.json, package-lock.json, lib/ and worker/. Without
# this file the whole checkout went up to the builder on every deploy — 2.2 GB
# of dist/, public/ and node_modules/ on 2026-10-18, for a 583 MB image.
# Vercel does not read this file; it is the worker's alone.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!lib
!worker
worker/RUNBOOK.md
